## X-Date: $Date: 2007-11-13 18:34:54 -0600 (Tue, 13 Nov 2007) $
## X-Category: UnitFrames
## X-Email: karlkfi@yahoo.com
## X-Localizations: enUS, deDE
## X-CompatibleLocales: enUS, enGB, deDE
